  "review": "<div class=\"my-6 p-4 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-900 via-orange-950 to-stone-900 text-white shadow-md flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-3\">\n  <div class=\"space-y-0.5 text-center sm:text-left\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-center sm:justify-start gap-1.5 text-amber-300 font-extrabold text-xs\">\n      <span>🍁</span><span>2026年 秋〜初冬旅行の予約速報</span>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-200\">\n      秋の紅葉見頃シーズンや連休の温泉宿は早期割引プランが人気です。希望の日程はお早めの空室チェックが安心です。\n    </p>\n  </div>\n  <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Fhb.afl.rakuten.co.jp%2Fhgc%2F54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583%2F%3Fpc%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fimg.travel.rakuten.co.jp%252Fimage%252Ftr%252Fapi%252Fkw%252FJBe8h%252F%253Ff_no%253D5770\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"shrink-0 px-4 py-2 bg-amber-500 hover:bg-amber-400 text-stone-950 font-black text-xs rounded-xl shadow transition transform hover:scale-105\">\n    🔍 秋保温泉 心和む名湯の宿 曽良一のお得な自慢の温泉＆空室状況はこちら →\n  </a>\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b-2 border-amber-500 pb-2 mb-4\">【秋保温泉】仙台奥座敷のおすすめ温泉旅館7選！豪華バイキング＆室内プール付きリゾート</h2>\n<p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">仙台市街地から車で約30分とアクセス良好な「秋保温泉 心和む名湯の宿 曽良一」。歴史ある名湯とともに、充実した温泉プールや出来立てを味わうライブキッチンビュッフェなど、三世代家族やカップルで寛げる名宿を厳選しました。</p>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 border-b border-amber-300 pb-1 mt-6 mb-3\">🏨 厳選おすすめ宿泊施設</h3>\n<div class=\"space-y-6 my-4\">\n  <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-amber-200 shadow-sm space-y-3\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4 items-center\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/5770/5770.jpg\" alt=\"秋保温泉　心和む名湯の宿　曽良一\" class=\"w-full md:w-48 h-36 object-cover rounded-xl shadow-inner flex-shrink-0\" />\n      <div class=\"flex-grow space-y-1.5\">\n        <span class=\"inline-block px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-500 text-white font-bold text-[10px] rounded-full\">特選おすすめ</span>\n        <h4 class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 text-base leading-snug\">秋保温泉　心和む名湯の宿　曽良一</h4>\n        <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-600\">宮城県仙台市太白区秋保町湯元字薬師108 ｜ ＪＲ仙台駅よりバス５０分。秋保温泉湯元バス停下車１分。仙台南インターよりお車で１５分。</p>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-xs text-stone-700 pt-1\">\n          <span class=\"font-bold text-amber-600\">⭐ 4.19（1492件の評価）</span>\n          <span class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">1名目安: ¥9,900〜</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 bg-amber-50/60 p-2.5 rounded-lg border border-amber-100\">客室は全１６室。華やかさではなく、静かに寄り添う“こころなごむひととき”を。</p>\n    <div class=\"text-right pt-2\">\n      <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Fhb.afl.rakuten.co.jp%2Fhgc%2F54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583%2F%3Fpc%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fimg.travel.rakuten.co.jp%252Fimage%252Ftr%252Fapi%252Fkw%252FJBe8h%252F%253Ff_no%253D5770\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-6 py-2.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange-500 text-white font-bold text-xs rounded-xl shadow hover:opacity-95 transition\">\n        楽天トラベルでプラン・空室を見る ≫\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"p-4 bg-stone-50/80 rounded-xl border border-stone-200 space-y-2.5\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-3 items-center\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/15989/15989.jpg\" alt=\"秋保温泉　篝火の湯　緑水亭\" class=\"w-full md:w-36 h-24 object-cover rounded-lg flex-shrink-0\" />\n      <div class=\"flex-grow space-y-1\">\n        <h4 class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 text-sm\">秋保温泉　篝火の湯　緑水亭</h4>\n        <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-600\">宮城県仙台市太白区秋保町湯元上原27-2</p>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-xs text-stone-700\">\n          <span class=\"text-amber-600 font-bold\">⭐ 4.25</span>\n          <span>参考: ¥10,450〜</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </